{"id":"sonnenschein","lemma":"Sonnenschein","pos":"noun","rank":4012,"glosses":["sunshine"],"ipa":"/ˈzɔnənʃaɪ̯n/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/68/De-Sonnenschein.ogg/De-Sonnenschein.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Sonnenscheines"},"examples":[{"text":"Dieses Zimmer bekommt viel Sonnenschein ab.","en":"This room gets a lot of sunshine.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"room"},{"g":"to receive","l":"bekommen"},{"g":"much, a lot"},null,{"g":"beginning at that time…"}]},{"text":"Komm und genieße den Sonnenschein.","en":"Come and enjoy the sunshine.","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to enjoy","l":"genießen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Pflanzen brauchen Sonnenschein und Wasser.","en":"Plants need sunshine and water.","words":[{"g":"to plant"},{"g":"to need"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"water"}]},{"text":"Nach dem Regen kommt Sonnenschein.","en":"After a storm comes a calm.","words":[{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"rain"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null]},{"text":"Das Zimmer war von Sonnenschein durchflutet.","en":"The room was bathed in sunshine.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"room"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"from / of"},null,null]}]}